287
00:19:48,000 --> 00:19:48,480
Sir.

288
00:19:49,079 --> 00:19:49,559
Thanks.

289
00:19:49,559 --> 00:19:49,960
Sure.

290
00:19:50,839 --> 00:19:51,440
Mr. Zhou.

291
00:19:51,880 --> 00:19:52,519
Mr. Zhou.

292
00:19:52,759 --> 00:19:54,440
